  "body": "## Changelog\n* e8566e3c164a1b21c99ed6a5155f7fe6a08df3cb Add tests for MinReplicasDeployment\n* 7c7f9d7ff5b50c41b1ef4c06968a1142efab6c1d Add tests for MinReplicasHPA\n* 3c0ad34fcd8e05bd4e9b174078dc56b45a8e60c8 Fix optional check for seccomp #590\n* 3b4bd66fff09678a1d5e828489cac6eb78ece25a Update Go in Docker\n* a9e9d620d1173164005b2046b387d475ec6b38ac add description about probe identical checks\n* 2979637f8beaebb98baf98115c0e7be959662fdc add description for JUnit test reports\n* b17cabf06dd79bdedf35b10bd9bc674c0ed59a28 build(deps): bump github.com/fatih/color from 1.17.0 to 1.18.0\n* 9a861f668c169ab86aa5913886dcedfb418f21c0 build(deps): bump github.com/google/go-cmp from 0.6.0 to 0.7.0\n* de17876b6c502a6a04a08fb9b5d1c39fd8588214 build(deps): bump github.com/spf13/pflag from 1.0.5 to 1.0.6\n* a363030f7a4ad29f30d5e7e3ea7776c65d0fa87c build(deps): bump github.com/stretchr/testify from 1.9.0 to 1.10.0\n* 33bd4e39a7330be47681a5ba55e9a2eef0da7925 build(deps): bump golang.org/x/net from 0.30.0 to 0.33.0\n* 9307c9a7abed59cdc9ac5ffb7320ddfeadda6756 build(deps): bump golang.org/x/net from 0.33.0 to 0.36.0\n* f2dd79e5f7542f989681becae958ae0de45517a7 build(deps): bump golang.org/x/term from 0.24.0 to 0.25.0\n* 4ccb5ccfbb6013cef8816eacdf77ac16f28f292d build(deps): bump golang.org/x/term from 0.25.0 to 0.26.0\n* 6118c3e200fbd41e63e71b902271c6f25071fdc0 build(deps): bump golang.org/x/term from 0.26.0 to 0.27.0\n* 76081f5d90e2026ca528d6d5e97a9ab59717d9a4 build(deps): bump golang.org/x/term from 0.27.0 to 0.28.0\n* 5fc1c087c70541b57e9247efedd659b9e88a53d8 build(deps): bump golang.org/x/term from 0.28.0 to 0.31.0\n* 67cafc0cba6f9e57f08bcf89d82a93414966df46 build(deps): bump k8s.io/api from 0.31.1 to 0.31.2\n* 91c46692b314d78d2aa9d01d35479c02a1238b4f build(deps): bump k8s.io/api from 0.31.2 to 0.31.3\n* 5de005483730517b25364b3174d99b8fd76b6843 build(deps): bump k8s.io/api from 0.31.3 to 0.32.0\n* 7ccf49c9b0ae3a8e9a66713e560f1782a4da1cf9 build(deps): bump k8s.io/api from 0.